  "title": "TC Energy to host second quarter 2026 conference call on July 30",
  "summary": "CALGARY, Alberta, July 09, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- TC Energy Corporation (TSX, NYSE: TRP) (TC Energy or the Company) will hold a teleconference and webcast on Thursday, July 30, 2026, to discuss its second quarter financial results. François Poirier, TC Energy President and Chief Executive Officer, Sean O’Donnell, Executive Vice-President and Chief Financial Officer and other members of the executive leadership team will discuss the financial results and Company developments at 6:30 a.m. MT / 8:30...",
